<title>UK: Essen Hypobank sets 1.5 bln mark January 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypobank sets 1.5 bln mark January 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOBANK IN ESSEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/16 PCT  PAY DATE  * 17.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.09    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES    * FIRST COUPON DATE IS 15.JUL.97, SEVEN-MONTH LIBOR</p>
<p> LISTING    DDORF     DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
